</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="S3.F4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Word clouds illustrating the class distribution of the datasets.<span id="S3.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> In contrast to the pre-annotated FOD datasets (e.g., (a), (b)), the COD datasets processed by our LVLM pipeline (e.g., (c), (d)) exhibit a significantly richer and more diverse set of class labels.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
