<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S3.T1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Detailed composition of the UAVDE-2M dataset.<span id="S3.T1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Our UAVDE-2M dataset was constructed by sourcing and processing data from a diverse range of existing open-source datasets.</span></span></figcaption>
